1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:05,372
1872: a ship found sailing with nobody on board

2
00:00:05,122 --> 00:00:08,789
Six months of food and water, untouched

3
00:00:08,539 --> 00:00:13,041
1,700 barrels of alcohol. Nine were empty.

4
00:00:12,791 --> 00:00:16,767
The lifeboat was gone. So were all ten people.

5
00:00:16,667 --> 00:00:20,716
Why did they leave? A, B or C?

6
00:00:20,616 --> 00:00:24,245
Case still open. Your verdict?
